# Contrats de conception — serveur non implémenté
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = JETON_A_REMPLACER
@id = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Lister mes conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historique paginé
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Envoyer un message
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Exemple de conception du profil Dabber Khdma"
}

### Marquer la lecture
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{id}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

